  "details": "Currently, when taking a profile or invite picture, the red cones and lines marking VR camera are always visible, and appear in the picture you take. This can result in a mess of red overlays at times. There's not really a good reason for these to be displayed when taking such a picture, so it's probably best to just turn them off when in picture taking mode.",
